        "runs": [
          {
            "link": null,
            "styles": [],
            "text": "Buying multiple lamps for different rooms can get expensive. "
          },
          {
            "link": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/915959/govee-table-smart-lamp-classic-battery-rechargeable-matter-pricing",
            "styles": [
              "bold"
            ],
            "text": "Govee’s rechargeable Table Lamp Classic"
          },
          {
            "link": null,
            "styles": [],
            "text": " gives you one lamp you can use throughout your home instead of getting one for every room, and right now it’s down to $59 ($21 off) at "
          },
          {
            "link": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GLM9BBQT?tag=toysrein-20&tag=theverge02-20",
            "styles": [],
            "text": "Amazon"
          },
          {
            "link": null,
            "styles": [],
            "text": ". That’s just $4 shy of the all-time low set during Prime Day, and the smart lamp’s second-best price to date."
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
